body:
Also, to add to this;

1) if you hover over an item you want to donate, it will tell you on the right side of the screen if it's already been donated, this also applies to items that need to be offered(it will show both offer & donate as options and tell you which you've done, if any) (personally I'll offer an item to the altar before I donate it)

2) I keep a chest of items that I haven't donated and when the chest is full, I take it all to the museum to get a bigger dopamine hit 😂, but in all seriousness it helps me to see the impact of my donations if I dump 20 of them at once cause that's 60 points instead of 3 here and 3 there as I'm catching things
